-- =============================================================================
-- 97_fk_indexes.sql
-- Covering indexes for foreign keys that are not already served by another
-- index. Without them, deleting/updating a parent row scans the child table and
-- joins degrade as tenants grow. Partial (WHERE col IS NOT NULL) to stay small
-- for optional references. Generated by the FK lint in tests/lint.sql; keep the
-- lint at zero findings in CI.
-- =============================================================================

